#. module: l10n_ca_time_parameter
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_time_parameter.field_res_company__l10n_ca_quick_method_activity
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ca_time_parameter.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ca_quick_method_activity
msgid ""
"Selects the remittance rate table: service businesses and resellers have "
"different quick method rates. The resale rates require that the cost of the "
"goods purchased for resale, basic groceries excluded, is at least 40% of the"
" annual taxable sales."
msgstr ""
"Détermine la table des taux de versement : les entreprises de services et "
"les revendeurs ont des taux différents selon la méthode rapide. Les taux des"
" revendeurs exigent que le coût des biens achetés pour la revente, produits "
"alimentaires de base exclus, atteigne au moins 40 % des ventes taxables "
"annuelles."

#. module: l10n_ca_time_parameter
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_ca_time_parameter.selection__res_company__l10n_ca_quick_method_activity__service
